=== WEB SOURCE (the specification) ===
  features/automations/pages/ConditionBuilder.tsx — a CONTROLLED editor: `{ conditions, onChange }` props +
  ONE data hook (`useGeofences`). Renders a list of condition rows; each row is a kind <Select> + a per-kind
  field editor, plus a remove button; an "Add Condition" affordance appends a default signal condition.
  Four condition kinds, each a discriminated-union member:
    condition_signal          → signal <Select> + operator <Select> + value editor that ADAPTS to the signal
                                type: boolean signals → True/False <Select>; "state"/"in" → text <Input>;
                                "between" → Min/Max numeric <Input>s; else → numeric <Input>.
    condition_time_window     → start/end time <Input>s + timezone <Select> + day-of-week toggle buttons.
    condition_geofence        → geofence <Select> (options from useGeofences) + geofence-state <Select>.
    condition_other_automation→ automation-id <Input> + tracked-state <Select>.
  Helpers ported verbatim: createDefaultCondition · conditionValueFromInput · the `value` getter ·
  numericValue · parseFloat||0 / parseInt||0 · the operator filter (numericOnly hidden for bool) ·
  the day toggle (append+sort / remove) · geofenceOptions (placeholder-prepended) · the timezone label keying.

