=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces; the data source is `useGeofences`) ===
  loading  → geofence picker shows a spinner + "Loading saved places…"          (GeofencePresentation.loading)
  content  → placeholder-prepended options; live/stale/offline freshness chip    (.content)
  empty    → geofences resolved but none → placeholder-only select + "No saved places yet."  (.empty)
  error    → inline "Couldn't load saved places" + Retry (retryable)             (.error)
  stale    → amber stale chip on the loaded options + auto-refresh affordance     (.content/.stale)
  offline  → cached options + offline chip, OR (no cache) offline message + Retry (.content/.offline / .offlineNoData)
  Resolver unit-tested across ALL branches (GeofencePresentationTests: loading/loaded/empty/failed × cached/none).

